From 1443a56713d681588cb782f5234e488b3eaf76a2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 14:08:25 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] version: Reaper_v3.4.4

Since v3.4.3: AiMesh works with a Reaper main router again (the upgrade
contract, the node version string, the setup notice); hostapd no longer
pushes a de-authorize for a client the driver already dropped (the -30
pairs) and logs RADIUS accounting only when it exists; USB restarts the
NAS apps once per mount wave; Samba restarts on a WAN event only when the
WAN changed what it binds to; the QoS cards and the header tooltip say
what is true; Diagnostics v1.3.39 reads DNS Director, the port QoS really
shapes and every gateway.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 release/src-rt/version.conf | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/release/src-rt/version.conf b/release/src-rt/version.conf
index 2b1c3ee6140..88aa9a9f16d 100644
--- a/release/src-rt/version.conf
+++ b/release/src-rt/version.conf
@@ -4,6 +4,6 @@ KERNEL_VER_AM=$(subst .,,$(KERNEL_VER))
 FS_VER_AM=$(subst .,,$(FS_VER))
 
 SERIALNO=102.8
-EXTENDNO=Reaper_v3.4.3
+EXTENDNO=Reaper_v3.4.4
 
 RCNO=0
-- 
2.25.1

